# The studio is a Node app, not a Bazel target.
#
# Without this, `bazel build //...` walks studio/node_modules — tens of
# thousands of files, several of which contain BUILD files of their own from
# unrelated ecosystems — and either takes minutes or fails on one of them.
# The studio has its own gate: .github/workflows/studio.yml runs tsc, the
# tests, and `buf generate && git diff --exit-code`, so it is checked, just not
# here.
studio
